e</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each game of Lunchbreak Tactics starts with three simple but crucial choices: one hero and two clans. Your hero gives you a special passive power while the two clans determine the units you'll get during the game.  From this point on, build a squad of units to battle opponents across thirteen rounds to gain the most reputation and climb the ranks!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Countless Synergies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match over a hundred units and dozens of heroes to create the perfect synergies. The possibilities are endless!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3002240/extras/9743a1f8efbe683c9b87e186ffdcbcf5.poster.avif?t=1759334936\" width=500 height=281 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3002240/extras/9743a1f8efbe683c9b87e186ffdcbcf5.webm?t=1759334936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play At Your Own Pace</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is built around an asynchronous multiplayer experience, meaning that you can play at your own rhythm, when you want and as fast or slow as you want.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cute and Quirky Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyday objects are brought to life and given new roles as wizards and witches, paladins and pirates.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Perfect Game for Your Lunchbreak</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick to pick up and play yet endlessly rewarding, this is truly the perfect game for all your future lunchbreaks and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3002240/extras/fbeb5f4c496df6cc170460a6afcc6635.poster.avif?t=1759334936\" width=500 height=281 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3002240/extras/fbeb5f4c496df6cc170460a6afcc6635.webm?t=1759334936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Borealys Lab"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3002240/3cb78e3b583a3580e9f62f5b10464a9742cfa588/header.jpg?t=1759334936","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3002240/570466374/34f692e0ec6ce5415253f3613b61a1f1d3aea837/1758859632/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758862084","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3002240/570466374/34f692e0ec6ce5415253f3613b61a1f1d3aea837/1758859632/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758862084","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3002240/570466374/34f692e0ec6ce5415253f3613b61a1f1d3aea837/1758859632/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758862084","id":257206631,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257206631/movie480.mp4?t=1758862084","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257206631/movie_max.mp4?t=1758862084"},"name":"Reveal Trailer - Lunchbreak Tactics","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257206631/80359f0e032a2774abb38ed37a8e756faa9b7795/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758862084","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257206631/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1758862084","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257206631/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1758862084"}}],"name":"Lunchbreak Tactics","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<